   Replaced the original multi-part internal implementation with a single return statement that returns `self.replace(mapping, default=default, return_dtype=return_dtype)`.
   The original implementation included:

   * Function definition: define `_remap_key_or_value_series` to construct and validate a `Series` of remapping keys or values;
